   "text": "ONE transition is automatic: NOT STARTED \u2192 IN PROGRESS, when a sync reports playtime > 0 on a game whose status_manual is NULL. Every other arrow on this sheet is the player.",
   "originalText": "ONE transition is automatic: NOT STARTED \u2192 IN PROGRESS, when a sync reports playtime > 0 on a game whose status_manual is NULL. Every other arrow on this sheet is the player.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 290058226,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1791170115,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t548082880",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 180.0,
   "y": 1000.0,
   "width": 1544.3999999999999,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#FF8A8A",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "A SYNC NEVER WRITES status_manual. Mark a game ZERADO, then play three more hours: playtime updates, last_played_at updates, the state does not. That invariant is what makes the product trustworthy.",
   "originalText": "A SYNC NEVER WRITES status_manual. Mark a game ZERADO, then play three more hours: playtime updates, last_played_at updates, the state does not. That invariant is what makes the product trustworthy.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1437238777,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1174608190,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t83284895",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 180.0,
   "y": 1060.0,
   "width": 1411.8,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#8FD0FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "ZERADO is never inferred. 100% achievements may SUGGEST it in Phase 2 \u2014 a dismissible line the player accepts. A machine cannot hand someone the moment the product exists to create.",
   "originalText": "ZERADO is never inferred. 100% achievements may SUGGEST it in Phase 2 \u2014 a dismissible line the player accepts. A machine cannot hand someone the moment the product exists to create.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1569504492,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1090816181,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t1100188490",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 180.0,
   "y": 1120.0,
   "width": 1380.6,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#9DC4E6",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "All twelve ordered pairs are legal. For providers with no playtime capability \u2014 physical copies, and any store whose API does not report it \u2014 all four states are manual, always.",
   "originalText": "All twelve ordered pairs are legal. For providers with no playtime capability \u2014 physical copies, and any store whose API does not report it \u2014 all four states are manual, always.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
