   "width": 360,
   "height": 18,
   "strokeColor": "#9DC4E6",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "The four game states and their transitions. Every arrow but one is the player. effective_status = status_manual ?? derive(playtime, capabilities).",
